When Should You Replace Instead of Repair?
While many garage door problems can be repaired, replacement may be the better option if:
    • The door has extensive structural damage.
    • Multiple components have failed.
    • The garage door is more than 15–20 years old.
    • Repairs are becoming frequent and costly.
    • You want improved insulation, security, and energy efficiency.
A qualified technician can inspect your garage door and recommend the most cost-effective solution.
